Act V: മൂന്ന് position pours SAVE സഹിതം കണക്കാക്കുന്നു.

Scene I: pour 1 = SAVE(drop^2 + WHEAT*old[order1] + 3*i).
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Tybalt]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the product of Portia and Portia.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of Miranda and Beatrice.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of the sum of a big hero and a hero and Viola.
 You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
 You are as good as the remainder of the quotient between yourself and Shylock.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene II: pour 2 = SAVE(drop^2 + BARLEY*old[order2] + 5*i).
[Enter Prospero and Iago]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the product of Portia and Portia.
