 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of the sum of a big big hero and a hero and Viola.
 You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
 You are as good as the remainder of the quotient between yourself and Shylock.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene III: pour 3 = SAVE(drop^2 + SALT*old[order3] + 7*i).
[Enter Prospero and Horatio]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the product of Portia and Portia.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of Caliban and Mercutio.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of the difference between a big big big hero and a hero and Viola.
 You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
 You are as good as the remainder of the quotient between yourself and Shylock.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]

